{"hw":"νεόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">νεόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">νεόω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">νέος</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">renovate, change,</b> <span class=\"gk\">νέωσον αἶνον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">534</span> </span> (lyr.):— <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">τάφους ἐνεώσατο</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">had</b> them <b class=\"lex-tr\">restored,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">IG</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.1721</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> = νεάω, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Poll.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.221</span> </span>: c. acc. cogn., <span class=\"gk\">νεώσατε ἑαυτοῖς νεώματα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Je.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">restore</b> a M<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> </span> reading in a corrupt passage, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Demetr.Lac.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Herc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1012.26</span> </span>.</div></div>"}